the annual earned income initial exclusion limit is 780, as stated in "42 USC 1382a(b)(4)(A)(i), (B)(i), (C)".

the earned income remainder exclusion rate is a rate R if
    R = 1 / 2.

rule blind_branch_earned_income_excluded with provenance "42 USC 1382a(b)(4)(A)(i)":
the blind branch earned income excluded of a person is an amount N if
    the individual or spouse of the person satisfies blind branch status condition
    and the earned income not excluded by preceding paragraphs of the person is an amount M
    and the annual earned income initial exclusion limit is an amount K
    and the earned income remainder exclusion rate is a rate R
    and the maximum of 0 and M is a number P
    and the minimum of P and K is a number Q
    and a number S = M - K
    and the maximum of 0 and S is a number T
    and N = Q + R * T
    otherwise the person is a person
    and N = 0.

rule blind_branch_earning_expenses_excluded with provenance "42 USC 1382a(b)(4)(A)(ii)":
the blind branch earning expenses excluded of a person is an amount N if
    the individual or spouse of the person satisfies blind branch status condition
    and the expenses reasonably attributable to earning income of the person is an amount M
    and the maximum of 0 and M is N
    otherwise the person is a person
    and N = 0.

rule blind_branch_self_support_plan_other_income_excluded with provenance "42 USC 1382a(b)(4)(A)(iii)":
the blind branch self support plan other income excluded of a person is an amount N if
    the individual or spouse of the person satisfies blind branch status condition
    and the individual of the person has commissioner approved plan for achieving self support
    and the other income amount necessary for fulfillment of self support plan of the person is an amount M
    and the maximum of 0 and M is N
    otherwise the person is a person
    and N = 0.

rule disabled_branch_earned_income_excluded with provenance "42 USC 1382a(b)(4)(B)(i)-(iii)":
the disabled branch earned income excluded of a person is an amount N if
    the individual or spouse of the person satisfies disabled not blind branch status condition
    and the earned income not excluded by preceding paragraphs of the person is an amount M
    and the annual earned income initial exclusion limit is an amount K
    and the disability work expense amount necessary and within commissioner limits of the person is an amount P
    and the earned income remainder exclusion rate is a rate R
    and the maximum of 0 and M is a number Q
    and the minimum of Q and K is a number S
    and a number T = M - S
    and the maximum of 0 and T is a number U
    and the maximum of 0 and P is a number V
    and the minimum of U and V is a number W
    and a number X = M - S - W
    and the maximum of 0 and X is a number Y
    and N = S + W + R * Y
    otherwise the person is a person
    and N = 0.

rule disabled_branch_self_support_plan_other_income_excluded with provenance "42 USC 1382a(b)(4)(B)(iv)":
the disabled branch self support plan other income excluded of a person is an amount N if
    the individual or spouse of the person satisfies disabled not blind branch status condition
    and the individual of the person has commissioner approved plan for achieving self support
    and the other income amount necessary for fulfillment of self support plan of the person is an amount M
    and the maximum of 0 and M is N
    otherwise the person is a person
    and N = 0.

rule age_sixty_five_branch_earned_income_excluded with provenance "42 USC 1382a(b)(4)(C)":
the age sixty five branch earned income excluded of a person is an amount N if
    the individual or spouse of the person has attained age sixty five and is not included under subparagraph_a or b
    and the earned income not excluded by preceding paragraphs of the person is an amount M
    and the annual earned income initial exclusion limit is an amount K
    and the earned income remainder exclusion rate is a rate R
    and the maximum of 0 and M is a number P
    and the minimum of P and K is a number Q
    and a number S = M - K
    and the maximum of 0 and S is a number T
    and N = Q + R * T
    otherwise the person is a person
    and N = 0.

